{
  "file_name": "f006.bf",
  "total_messages": 118,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "offset": "YES_NO",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Yes.\nNo.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "offset": "hungry",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> Serph and the party feel hungry...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "offset": "hungry02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> They grew weak from hunger.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "offset": "sera_01a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "No one can avoid the fate which\nrains from the heavens...\nThe only thing I can do... is pray.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "offset": "sera_01b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "He had already been... overtaken\nby the virus...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "offset": "heat_01a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I don't think anything surprises\nme anymore.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "offset": "heat_01b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Look at that building.\nSeen it before, haven't you?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "offset": "heat_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Don't waste time worrying about\nthings you can't change.\nWe can't abandon Sera... our comrade.\nThat's all you need to know.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "offset": "heat_SISEI_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Damn these bastards!\nMakin' us waste our time...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "offset": "heat_SISEI_02a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It's not like we can help people\nwho have already been devoured.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "offset": "heat_SISEI_02b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Hurry up! We need to find Sera!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "offset": "heat_SISEI_03a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "You care too much about others,\ny'know that?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "offset": "heat_SISEI_03b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "If we're gonna do this,\nthen hurry the hell up, already!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "offset": "heat_SISEI_04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sera... don't do anything stupid.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "offset": "heat_SISEI_05a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What a waste of time.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "offset": "heat_SISEI_05b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Okay, everyone's happy.\nLet's get going!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "offset": "arujila_01a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "That's Varin's headquarters?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "offset": "arujila_01b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Serph, isn't that...?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "offset": "arujila_02a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "This... This is Sera's house.\nWe came here all the time...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "offset": "arujila_02b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "No... I want to remember...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "offset": "aljira_SISEI_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Nobody's here... Don't tell me\nthey've all been...!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "offset": "aljira_SISEI_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "This couldn't have happened at\na worse time!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "offset": "aljira_SISEI_03a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "This Atma crap only accomplishes\none thing.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "offset": "aljira_SISEI_03b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What good is a world where one\nperson stands alone on the bodies\nof his slain enemies?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "offset": "aljira_SISEI_04a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "We've killed three of them,\nso that means their boss must\nbe in the final area.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "offset": "aljira_SISEI_04b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "...But, something doesn't seem\nright, don't you think?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "offset": "aljira_SISEI_05a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Let's get back to the tower,\nSerph.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "offset": "aljira_SISEI_05b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It's time to face our destiny, and\nlearn the truth about our lives.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "offset": "npc_01_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Varin Omega is dangerous. He must\nnot be allowed to reach Nirvana.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "offset": "npc_07_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "We were only following the Colonel's\norders.\nPlease take us with you. I want\nto see my wife and daughter!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "offset": "npc_06_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "You'll treat the prisoners of war\nhumanely, right?\nI've seen enough death...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "offset": "npc_05_01a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Some of Varin's loyalists are\nfinally starting to surrender.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "offset": "npc_05_01b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I can't really understand them,\nthough.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "offset": "npc_02_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "You and Varin share a destiny...\nI know, because I died on that day.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "offset": "npc_002_03_01a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "How are you holding up?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "offset": "npc_002_03_01b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sir, may I ask you something?\nYou've... been inside there\nbefore, haven't you?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "offset": "npc_002_03_01_SEL",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "That building? ...Yes.\nNo, I haven't.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "offset": "npc_002_03_01_ans0a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Have you seen a demon with\n\"beautiful silver wings?\" He is\nsooo dreamy.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "offset": "npc_002_03_01_ans0b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I want to meet him, but I totally\nfreeze up when I try to go inside.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "offset": "npc_002_03_01_ans0c",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Squeee!\nMaybe he'll give me his phone\nnumber!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "offset": "npc_002_03_01_ans0d",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "--?\nHis what?\nWhat are you talking about?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "offset": "npc_002_03_01_ans1a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Why are you being like that?\nWe know you've been in there.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "offset": "npc_002_03_01_ans1b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "We already know you've been\ninside that building.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "offset": "npc_002_03_02a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "So that demon hunk has a\ngirlfriend...\n*sigh* Major bummer.\nI'm not sure my heart will ever\nrecover from the shock.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "offset": "npc_002_03_02b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Come on, cheer up.\nLet's have a sleepover and eat\nice cream until morning.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "offset": "npc_002_03_02c",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "--?\nWhat are you talking about?\n...sounds fun, though.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "offset": "ciero_01a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Dat building...\nIt looks like it's made a' digital\nimages or sumthin'.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "offset": "ciero_01b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Doesn't it look weird?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "offset": "ciero_02a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Yaah, I see it now.\nDis was Sera's house...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "offset": "ciero_02b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "But, we died in Nirvana, didn't we...?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "offset": "ciero_02c",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What is Sera's house doin' here,\nden?\nWe ain't in Nirvana.\nThis don't make sense, mon.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "offset": "ciero_SISEI_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What de hell dey want now?\nWe already won, ja?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "offset": "ciero_SISEI_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What should we do, bro?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "offset": "ciero_SISEI_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It sucks dat we gotta deal wit\ndis instead of just going to\nde Temple.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "offset": "ciero_SISEI_04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Three places down, ja?\nLet's look for deir boss, then!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "offset": "ciero_SISEI_05",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "All our comrades were s'posed ta\ngo to Nirvana wit' us...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "offset": "npc_03_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Serph! I just remembered\neverything!\nI used to be in a Tribe called\n\"Business.\"\nIt was so cutthroat... I couldn't\ntake it anymore... and...\n...I hung myself.\nPlease...!\nTell me what this means!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "offset": "gale_01a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Ruling by power is effective\nuntil people refuse to acknowledge\nthat power.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "offset": "gale_01b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "In us, the Karma Temple has\nengineered its own demise.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "offset": "gale_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It's obvious now that I'm different\nfrom the rest of you.\nI did not exist in Varin's memory.\nYou five are special.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "offset": "gale_02_SEL",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What do you mean?\nYes... I agree.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "offset": "gale_02_ans0a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I speculate there are two types of\npeople in the Junkyard.\nThose such as Heat, Argilla, Cielo\nand yourself, who share memories\nwith Sera...\n...and those whose past memories\nare lost, and who are not connected\nwith Sera--like Lupa and myself.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "offset": "gale_02_ans0b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "However, considering Sera's\nhouse is here...\nIt's still not clear if we all died\nin Nirvana, as Varin said...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "offset": "gale_02_ans1a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Let us hope that our theory\nis correct.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "offset": "gale_02_ans1b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "We could be wrong.\n...There may be something else\nbehind all of this.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "offset": "gale_SISEI_01a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "They either fled, or were\ndevoured.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "offset": "gale_SISEI_01b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Whichever case, the report seems\nto be true.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "offset": "gale_SISEI_02a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Dealing with them will not change\nour situation.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "offset": "gale_SISEI_02b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "However, they did kill some\nof our comrades.\nThis could be considered revenge\nfor such needless killing.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "offset": "gale_SISEI_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "If we are victorious, then all\nwars will end.\nI truly hope that this comes\nto pass.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "offset": "gale_SISEI_04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "There isn't time to lose.\nIf we're going to eliminate them,\nlet's do it quickly.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "offset": "gale_SISEI_05a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sera knows all about this world,\nand everything about us.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "offset": "gale_SISEI_05b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Let's head for the Temple, Serph.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "offset": "npc_04_01a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It stopped raining...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "offset": "npc_04_01b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What's going on, sir!?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "offset": "npc_04_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "We didn't anticipate a cowardly\nambush because we assumed our\nenemies were true soldiers.\nIf we knew to think like cowards,\nyou would be prisoners by now.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "offset": "npc_05_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
